    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21103" root="سهم" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْهُومٌ</span></b> , applied to a man, <i>Lean,</i> or <i>lank in the
belly:</i> [see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاهِمٌ</span>:] or <i>affected with what is
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سهام</span> [app. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَهَام</span>, and meaning <i>the heat of
the wind called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمُوم</span>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And, applied
to a camel, <i>Smitten with the disease termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُهَام</span>: and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَهَّمَةٌ</span></b>  applied to camels. (S, K.)

